-Yeah.

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:29.999
-And this is
the fire department.

00:04:30.032 --> 00:04:31.767
-I feel like that's something
that I want to be a part of,

00:04:31.767 --> 00:04:33.536
maybe after playing football.

00:04:33.536 --> 00:04:35.538
-So let's go meet some
of your biggest fans.

00:04:35.538 --> 00:04:36.973
-Let's do it.

00:04:36.973 --> 00:04:39.642
-Yeah, yeah, yeah, he's here!
-How you doing?

00:04:39.642 --> 00:04:41.277
All righty, guys.
Good to meet you.

00:04:41.277 --> 00:04:44.480
-Face of the Jets meeting
the face of the city.

00:04:44.513 --> 00:04:47.183
-Sam's grandfather
was a fireman.

00:04:47.216 --> 00:04:49.852
-Yeah, in LA.
-Truly special to him.

00:04:50.119 --> 00:04:51.454
But we told him no going down

00:04:51.487 --> 00:04:53.422
