or anything like that.

00:04:53.422 --> 00:04:56.425
We got to draw the line.
-Yeah, Coach Bowles --

00:04:56.425 --> 00:04:58.294
Coach Bowles
might get a little mad.

00:04:59.816 --> 00:05:02.685
Pray for me.
-Oh, there he is.

00:05:02.722 --> 00:05:04.330
-This is my boy.

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:06.398
This is my proud boy.

00:05:06.403 --> 00:05:08.906
He's becoming a New York man.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:10.053
-It is hot in here.

00:05:10.053 --> 00:05:13.089
-Dude, he looks like
a fireman, right?

00:05:13.094 --> 00:05:15.169
[ horn blares ]

00:05:15.169 --> 00:05:18.016
-What's up?
Fireman for the day.

00:05:18.016 --> 00:05:19.885
Oh, that's so much power.

00:05:19.921 --> 00:05:22.363
This is so cool.

00:05:22.363 --> 00:05:24.372
Get the hell outta my way!

00:05:24.372 --> 00:05:26.415
What're you doin'?!

00:05:26.415 --> 00:05:29.785
[ horn blaring ]

00:05:29.812 --> 00:05:32.917
