if I was wearing the jacket.

00:05:32.917 --> 00:05:35.054
-You're a natural.
-Oh, yeah. That was fun.

00:05:35.054 --> 00:05:38.025
-You're a New Yorker now.
-It's official.

00:05:38.025 --> 00:05:40.060
