like "I hope you beat the Pats"?

00:05:43.953 --> 00:05:45.088
-Yeah.
-That's right.

00:05:45.154 --> 00:05:46.789
-Got to beat Brady
and those guys.

00:05:47.711 --> 00:05:49.346
-Right.
-"Belichick and those guys."

00:05:49.378 --> 00:05:50.754
-Yeah.

00:05:50.754 --> 00:05:52.456
-We got to beat some
other teams, too.

00:05:52.456 --> 00:05:54.027
