who can hit my trash can.

00:06:02.778 --> 00:06:06.128
-Sam's going first.
Sometimes Texas beats USC.

00:06:06.128 --> 00:06:09.599
Oh.
-Oh, Simms --

00:06:12.459 --> 00:06:15.362
Simms has the line.
-Oh!

00:06:15.459 --> 00:06:18.462
[ crowd ohhs ]

00:06:18.462 --> 00:06:19.129
-Go.

00:06:19.159 --> 00:06:21.691
[ cheers and applause ]

00:06:21.691 --> 00:06:23.126
-Whoo!

00:06:27.182 --> 00:06:29.384
42nd Street, Times Square.

00:06:32.403 --> 00:06:33.592
What?!

00:06:33.609 --> 00:06:35.753
This is Sam Darnold!

00:06:35.773 --> 00:06:36.866
What?!

00:06:36.884 --> 00:06:39.854
The Jets rule!

00:06:39.879 --> 00:06:41.967
Get your ass outta here!

00:06:41.967 --> 00:06:43.536
