have you been in?

00:06:43.536 --> 00:06:44.738
That's the question
I want to get to.

00:06:44.738 --> 00:06:47.460
-I'm serious.
He's just picking fights.

00:06:47.466 --> 00:06:48.624
-I can be confrontational.

00:06:49.482 --> 00:06:52.576
Who's your team?
-Cowboys!

00:06:52.576 --> 00:06:55.679
-Oh, when's the last time
you won a Super Bowl?

00:06:55.679 --> 00:06:57.320
-When's the last time
y'all won a Super Bowl?!

00:06:57.320 --> 00:07:00.763
-I don't know, but he's gonna
win it real soon, right here.

00:07:00.763 --> 00:07:05.235
Let's start it up.
Here we go.

00:07:05.257 --> 00:07:09.427
-J-E-T-S -- Jets, Jets, Jets!

00:07:10.042 --> 00:07:11.912
-I want to be best friends
with Sam Darnold,

00:07:11.912 --> 00:07:12.947
