00:07:12.947 --> 00:07:14.299
-Yeah, yeah.
Stalker alert.

00:07:14.299 --> 00:07:15.783
-Call me, Sam!
I miss you!

00:07:15.783 --> 00:07:17.720
Welcome to Lefkoe's GIF Shop.

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:20.524
It's where Simms knows football,
I know the internet,

00:07:20.524 --> 00:07:23.227
