you tell me if I'm right.

00:07:30.903 --> 00:07:34.106
First GIF is this one.
Thanos.

00:07:34.614 --> 00:07:37.352
This is what I believe
J.J. Watt will be,

00:07:37.352 --> 00:07:39.287
