00:07:39.319 --> 00:07:41.890
-Oh, man, I still can't believe
the Avengers lost this battle.

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:43.093
I'm so heartbroken about it.

00:07:43.093 --> 00:07:45.262
-Spoilers!
-Sorry, deal with it.

00:07:45.262 --> 00:07:48.141
And, no, J.J. Watt can't
beat Thanos!

00:07:48.141 --> 00:07:50.740
He's, like, the most charitable
nice guy in the world.

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:52.176
This guy's evil!
He's bad.

00:07:52.176 --> 00:07:52.977
Sorry.
-Yeah, but getting back, just

00:07:52.977 --> 00:07:55.079
