00:08:34.763 --> 00:08:36.031
All right, next GIF.

00:08:36.047 --> 00:08:38.078
This is the Lefkoe GIF Shop!

00:08:38.089 --> 00:08:40.992
This is what defenses
are gonna be like

00:08:40.992 --> 00:08:44.449
