00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:57.081
-I think it is.

00:08:57.081 --> 00:08:58.883
-30 points a game?
-30 points a game.

00:08:58.899 --> 00:09:01.705
Jimmy G, slam dunk, top five

00:09:01.705 --> 00:09:03.742
