00:09:20.641 --> 00:09:21.884
It's a quarterback thing, man.

00:09:21.884 --> 00:09:23.051
You stay over there, host.

00:09:23.070 --> 00:09:24.626
-Yeah, thanks a lot.
I appreciate it.

00:09:24.626 --> 00:09:26.186
-But Sam Darnold,
we spent time with him.

00:09:26.186 --> 00:09:27.654
And I said coming out
